# ISO 27001:2022 Statement of Applicability

## Project Overview
This project develops a risk-based Statement of Applicability (SoA) for a cloud-based SaaS company preparing for ISO 27001:2022 certification.

## Objectives
- Assess the applicability of Annex A controls.
- Document justifications for included and excluded controls.
- Map controls to identified information security risks.
- Record implementation status and evidence requirements.
- Prepare justifications for review by an auditor.
